# owl-transitive-property: a small runnable case for EYE RPO rules.
# Source: https://eyereasoner.github.io/eye/reasoning/rpo/owl-TransitiveProperty.n3
# Rules: MIT, Jos De Roo; sample data added for this example.

@prefix : <http://example.org/>.
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#>.
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>.
@prefix list: <http://www.w3.org/2000/10/swap/list#>.
@prefix log: <http://www.w3.org/2000/10/swap/log#>.

# Sample data
:ancestor a owl:TransitiveProperty. :alice :ancestor :bob. :bob :ancestor :carol. :carol :ancestor :dave.

# Inference rules
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#>.

{?P a owl:TransitiveProperty. ?S ?P ?X. ?X ?P ?O.} => {?S ?P ?O}.
